sequenceDiagram
    actor Creator as 创作者
    participant ProjPage as 项目详情页
    participant PubModal as 发布弹窗
    participant PublishSvc as PublishService
    participant DB as SQLite数据库
    actor Player as 访客玩家
    participant ExploreP as 探索列表页
    participant PlayPage as play/[id] 游玩页
    participant Engine as VN引擎(GameCanvas)

    %% 发布流程
    Creator->>ProjPage: 点击「发布作品」
    ProjPage->>PubModal: 打开发布配置弹窗
    Creator->>PubModal: 填写简介/封面/标签
    Creator->>PubModal: 点击「确认发布」
    PubModal->>PublishSvc: publishProject(id, userId, config)
    PublishSvc->>DB: 更新 Project.status = 'published'
    PublishSvc->>DB: 更新 publishedAt, tags, screenshots
    PublishSvc-->>PubModal: {shareUrl: '/play/abc-123'}
    PubModal-->>Creator: 显示分享链接 + 复制按钮
    Creator->>PubModal: 点击「复制链接」

    %% 访客浏览列表
    Player->>ExploreP: 访问 /explore
    ExploreP->>PublishSvc: listPublished(page=1, sortBy='popular')
    PublishSvc->>DB: 查询 published 项目 + 排序
    DB-->>PublishSvc: 返回项目列表
    PublishSvc-->>ExploreP: PublishedProjectSummary[]
    ExploreP-->>Player: 展示作品卡片网格

    %% 访客游玩
    Player->>PlayPage: 点击作品卡片 /play/abc-123
    PlayPage->>PublishSvc: recordView('abc-123', ip)
    PublishSvc->>DB: 更新 Project.viewCount += 1
    PlayPage->>PublishSvc: getPublishedProject('abc-123')
    PublishSvc->>DB: 查询项目 + 配置 + 资源映射
    DB-->>PublishSvc: 项目数据
    PublishSvc-->>PlayPage: 项目完整数据
    PlayPage-->>Player: 显示作品详情页（封面/信息/统计/开始游玩按钮）
    Player->>PlayPage: 点击「开始游玩」
    PlayPage->>PublishSvc: recordPlay('abc-123', sessionId)
    PublishSvc->>DB: 更新 Project.playCount += 1
    PlayPage->>Engine: 启动 VN 引擎
    Engine-->>Player: 全屏游戏体验
